<section class="cta section shell" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
  <h2 id="cta-title">Have a project in mind?</h2>
  <div class="cta-foot">
    <p>Whether you need custom software, an AI system, workflow automation or simply want to discuss whether an idea is technically feasible, I'm happy to have a conversation.</p>
    <a class="arrow-link" href="/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { max-width: 10ch; margin: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem) 0; font-family: Iowan Old Style, serif; font-size: clamp(4rem, 10.8vw, 11.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .82; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
  .cta-foot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: end; }
  .cta-foot p { max-width: 56ch; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .arrow-link { justify-self: end; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .cta-foot { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .arrow-link { justify-self: start; } }
</style>
